WEBVTT

00:11:29.956 --> 00:11:31.636
and grind up rock and spread it

00:11:31.636 --> 00:11:33.116
and capture CO2 from the air

00:11:33.116 --> 00:11:35.036
and find places to store it underground.

00:11:35.276 --> 00:11:36.276
All of those things.

00:11:36.276 --> 00:11:37.396
And there’s hundreds --

00:11:37.396 --> 00:11:39.636
thousands of people working right now

00:11:39.636 --> 00:11:44.236
to get those carbon removals approaches
out of the textbook

00:11:44.236 --> 00:11:45.876
and into practice,

00:11:45.876 --> 00:11:47.276
and to help us --

00:11:47.276 --> 00:11:49.356
God help us --

00:11:49.356 --> 00:11:53.516
reverse the damage we have done

00:11:53.516 --> 00:11:58.116
and start the process of climate healing.